    <td valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;padding:0 0 0 8px;"><b style="color:#03102F;">No card needed</b> - customers authorize subscriptions directly in WeChat, reducing drop-off from those without one.</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
  <tr>
    <td width="20" valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.6;padding:0;white-space:nowrap;">•</td>
    <td valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;padding:0 0 0 8px;"><b style="color:#03102F;">Cheaper than cards</b> - a flat 1.5%, undercutting typical Singapore card fees (2.8%+).</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:0;">
  <tr>
